<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mid Ocean cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mid Ocean cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Mid Ocean Ltd to neutral from outperform on price, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 47-7/8 Tuesday.</p>
</text>
